}}'''Lava''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that that is currently obtainable in the [[Summer Event 2025]] by purchasing the 13th tier in the Battle Pass for 800  [[Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} in the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]], or through trading.

== Appearance ==
The blade of this knife is violet, with various splatters of hot pink. The guard of it is a similar shade to the splatters, while the handle is pitch black.

